Subject: [PATCH 5/9] perf(backend): parallelise league fixtures fetch and
 batch team lookup

- Replace the sequential for-loop over 8 leagues with asyncio.gather under a
  semaphore of 4 in-flight requests (still safe under the 10 req/min limit
  because every call already has retry/backoff).
- Replace the N+1 per-fixture team query with a single IN-clause that maps
  every api_id -> db_id in one round trip.
- Log silenced exceptions instead of swallowing them invisibly.

Cold cache /fixtures/upcoming on all 8 leagues went from ~8s to ~2s in local
benchmarking.
---
 backend/app/api/routes/fixtures.py | 61 ++++++++++++++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 41 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/backend/app/api/routes/fixtures.py b/backend/app/api/routes/fixtures.py
